le didn't at NBC were not  excited about the show when we did the  pilot and there was only one guy at NBC  who really did like the idea of his name  was Rick Lauren he was from the late  night and specials department and he's  still with NBC in fact he's here tonight  [Applause]  his reward for saving seinfeld and  making it all happen is to stand and  monitor each one of our shows it wasn't  for him that would be an empty box right  yeah I deserves mentioning a we struggle  to in the first a little longer than you  probably and Rick Levin was one of the  people who stepped in and said I think  the show has potential and he was  eventually proven wrong so thank you  right our our thoughts are with you  tonight Rick and to all of your family  and your friends let's have a big hand  for mr. Strickland
 

